sequenceDiagram
    participant C1 as Client 1
    participant A1 as App Server 1
    participant R as Redis
    participant A2 as App Server 2
    participant C2 as Client 2
    participant DB as Database

    A1->>R: SUBSCRIBE cache:invalidations
    A2->>R: SUBSCRIBE cache:invalidations

    C1->>A1: Update user data
    A1->>DB: Save data
    A1->>R: PUBLISH cache:invalidations "user:1000"

    R->>A1: Message "user:1000"
    R->>A2: Message "user:1000"

    A1->>R: DEL user:1000
    A2->>R: DEL user:1000

    C2->>A2: Request user data
    A2->>DB: Query database (cache miss)
    DB->>A2: User data
    A2->>R: SET user:1000 {data}
    A2->>C2: Return user data